          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Meghna is an Indian restaurant in the west and in the moderate price range."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "What is the address?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "The address is 205 Victoria Road, Chesterton."
        }
