          "text": "Saigon City is at 169 High Street, Chesterton, and the phone number is 01223 356555."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Are there any other expensive Asian Oriental restaurants?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Kymmoy is in the centre at 52 Mill Road, City Centre. The phone number is 01223 311911."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Thank you. Goodbye."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "You’re welcome. Enjoy your meal!"
